  {
    "id": 1802001001010010,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "もしトーク番組とかインタビューの仕事があるときは\r\n他の仕事より余裕のある日程を組んでくれない？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "802",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スケジュールの連絡は早めにするつもりだが\r\nどうしてトークやインタビュー限定なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それは……私が毒舌なのは\r\nあなただって知ってるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "下手なことを口走らないように\r\n事前に話す内容を決めておきたいのよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010030"
  },
  {
    "select": "かなは普段から\r\n気をつけてるだろ",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001011"
  },
  {
    "select": "かなが毒舌なのは\r\n知られてないのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001012"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "決めておけば\r\n大丈夫なのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001001013"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010040,
    "label": "1802001001011",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "まあ、そうね。昔は色々やらかしてたから\r\n今は場の空気に合わせてるつもりよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それでも、口をすべらせることってあるでしょ\r\n迷惑をかけたくないし、できるだけ対策しておきたいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010060,
    "label": "1802001001012",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "スタッフならまだしも\r\nファンには知られてないはずよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "子役のときみたいに\r\n大御所気取りしてるって思われたくないから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010080,
    "label": "1802001001013",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それはまあ、会話の流れもあるから\r\n絶対ないとは言い切れないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001001010090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それでも心配されるなんて\r\n私にトーク番組の仕事は無理って言いたいの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100101/1802001001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うっ……しまった。別のことを言えば良かったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
